   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Work is retired on paper pages: a Section page is Report alone, and an old Work, Write or Revise link opens Draft;\nbuttons 1 · Draft, 2 · Plan, 3 · Evidence, 4 · Display (Display only when the Section has one); 📋 Review Content holds\nfive numbered sections, no state word on a bar; 🧭 Around the Work hides an empty section, and its heading when all are",
